$-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
$-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

$
$-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
$
$ Magnetic Gibbs energy per atom for Fe BCC (IHJ model: TC=1043K, beta=2.22, p=0.4)
$ Polynomial fit to G_mag(T) = [GM(BCC_A2,Fe) - GHSERFE] per atom
$ This is added to B2_221 endmembers as n_Fe*GMAGFE to match BCC_A2 at pure endpoints
$ Accuracy: max residual < 0.5 J/mol across 298.15-6000K
$
 FUNCTION GMAGFE 298.15
   -7.0146912562E-21*T**8
   +3.1491771454E-17*T**7
   -6.2381888381E-14*T**6
   +7.0296841149E-11*T**5
   -5.0301046827E-08*T**4
   +2.1540459933E-05*T**3
   -5.8205493954E-03*T**2
